en you do that all the focus lands on a specific aspect, and it succeeds or fails by it. For me personally, the action just wasn't exciting or interesting. It was fun, at the very least, which helped this game net a positive score from me, but I just can't play this game for long periods at a time.\n\nI'm very much interested in the Warhammer universe, however, and might give one of it's other games a go sometime.", "timestamp_created": 1581025034, "timestamp_updated": 1581025034, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558823525905609131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63054804", "author": {"steamid": "76561198417645950", "personaname": "Sly Silus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198417645950/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 348, "last_played": 1696870869, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "bloody, simple, and downright fun.", "timestamp_created": 1580993922, "timestamp_updated": 1580993922, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "63041679", "author": {"steamid": "76561198259116574", "personaname": "Frak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Undefined_Account/", "num_games_owned": 219, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 400, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 400, "last_played": 1536154707, "avatar": "caf89760